HB0162 Interactive gaming.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Davis, Brown, L, Larson, JT and
Tarver and Senator(s) Barlow, Pappas and Schuler
AN ACT relating to gaming; authorizing interactive gaming; providing for
regulation by the Wyoming gaming commission; imposing fees; providing for the
collection and distribution of revenues from interactive gaming; providing for
the distribution of interactive gaming revenues; requiring rulemaking; creating
criminal offenses and providing criminal penalties; and providing for effective
dates.
